# FedEx Assistant / DCA Management Platform

## Project Overview
This is a FedEx Assistant / DCA Management Platform designed to streamline debt collection agency (DCA) management.

## Environment Variables
- `OPENAI_API_KEY`: (Optional) Your OpenAI API key for AI enrichment features.

## Setup Instructions
1. Install dependencies: `npm install`
2. Start development server: `npm run dev`
3. Build for production: `npm run build`
4. Start production server: `npm start`

## AI Safety
The application is designed to run safely even if `OPENAI_API_KEY` is missing. Fallback logic will be used for recovery predictions.

## Storage
By default, the application uses In-Memory storage (MemStorage) for demonstration purposes.
